@startuml
title Core Lending Lifecycle Sequence (US-02 to US-08)
skinparam style strictuml
autonumber

actor Borrower
actor Lender
participant Frontend
participant Backend
database DB

== Request & Approval (US-02, US-03, US-05) ==
Borrower -> Frontend : Browse & request item
Frontend -> Backend : POST /api/requests
Backend -> DB : Save BorrowRequest (PENDING)
Backend --> Frontend : 201 Created

Lender -> Frontend : Approve request
Frontend -> Backend : POST /api/requests/{id}/approve
Backend -> DB : Request -> ACCEPTED, Item -> RESERVED
Backend --> Frontend : 200 OK

== Handover & Return Evidence (US-06, US-07) ==
Lender -> Frontend : Upload handover photo
Frontend -> Backend : POST /api/transactions/start/{requestId} & /api/evidence/transaction/{id}
Backend -> DB : Transaction (ACTIVE), Evidence (HANDOVER), Item -> BORROWED
Backend --> Frontend : 200 OK

Lender -> Frontend : Upload return photo & complete
Frontend -> Backend : POST /api/evidence/transaction/{id} & /api/transactions/{id}/complete
Backend -> DB : Evidence (RETURN), Transaction -> COMPLETED, Item -> AVAILABLE
Backend --> Frontend : 200 OK

== Audit History (US-08) ==
Borrower -> Frontend : View borrow history
Frontend -> Backend : GET /api/transactions/borrower/{id}
Backend -> DB : Load Transaction & EvidenceProof
Backend --> Frontend : 200 OK {proofs, timestamps}
@enduml
